{"id":7562,"profile":{"ID":7567,"title":"Megaminds: \u201cI Have a Dream\u201d","content":"","attr_title":"","menu_type":"resource","url":"\/resource\/megaminds-i-have-a-dream\/","slug":"megaminds-i-have-a-dream","parent":"7313","coords":"","offset":"","confirmation_status":"","event_length_seconds":"","point_of_contact":"","guest_type":"nominee","event_type":"","appearance_type":"","notes":"","classes":[""],"post":{"ID":7562,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2024-01-20 12:58:59","post_date_gmt":"2024-01-20 12:58:59","post_content":"\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStep into history with Martin Luther King Jr\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s \u00e2\u20ac\u0153I Have A Dream\u00e2\u20ac\u009d Room, a digital portal to one of the most pivotal moments in civil rights history. This interactive space brings to life Martin Luther King Jr.'s iconic \"I Have a Dream\" speech, allowing users to experience the event as if standing on the steps of the Lincoln Memorial.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECentral to this room is a 3D recreation of MLK delivering his speech, surrounded by multimedia elements that enrich the historical context. Explore interactive timelines, view historical photographs, and delve into key documents from the era, all while being immersed in the atmosphere of 1963. Visitors can interact with MLK's profound quotes, ponder their relevance today, and contribute to discussions, making the room a dynamic space for understanding and inspiration.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDesigned as a resource for both education and personal growth, the room includes lesson plans and further reading, making it ideal for educators and students exploring civil rights and social justice themes.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E","post_title":"Megaminds: \"I Have a Dream\"","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_statu